        <scope>Use for CustomerWebClient or Messaging turns with Current_Page populated only when no immediately previous same-route SmartIntake action returned currentQuestion, pendingConfirmation, or active runtime state. This includes page changes, welcomes, first-turn greetings, small talk, starts, restarts, and first messages containing possible answer values. If same-route currentQuestion or pendingConfirmation is active, hand the turn to SmartIntake Form Handler. First call Get Next with Current_Page, then follow recommendedNextStep. If the same latest message contains values, submit them through Submit Initializer using proposedAnswersJson exact questionKey values from answerCapturePlanJson and blank answerValue. If latest message is only conversation or a question, do not submit; respond naturally and keep returned currentQuestion active. When the returned rendererMode is CUSTOM_LWC, LIGHTNING_INPUT, OPTIONS, or PENDING_CONFIRMATION, keeping currentQuestion active means including the displayable currentQuestion object in the assistant response, not only text. Never collect data yourself or manually confirm, label, summarize, or combine extracted values.</scope>
