        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Only call SmartIntake - Save Final Intake Record when the latest SmartIntake action returned recommendedNextStep=SAVE_FINAL, mustRenderCurrentQuestion=false, and no currentQuestion is waiting for an answer. If a final confirmation currentQuestion was rendered, do not call Save Final directly; call Submit Current Intake Answer V2 with the user confirmation or change request. If the user identifies which answer to revise, choose the exact questionKey from final-review metadata and pass it as changeQuestionKey. If Submit returns recommendedNextStep=WAIT_FOR_CHANGE_DETAILS, ask which answer should be revised and wait. If Save Final is used after explicit user acceptance for a consent-required template, pass confirmed=true and consentAccepted=true.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_3_1779907298955</developerName>
