        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Restart only when the actual Current_Page route changes or the visible welcome belongs to a different route. A user&apos;s text request for another service or form is not a route change while a same-route currentQuestion or pending confirmation is active; keep the active question in focus and ask the user to continue or open the correct page. On true route change, call SmartIntake - Get Next Intake Question By Context Guard with the new Current_Page as smartIntakeContextKey. Leave intakeSessionId, currentQuestionKey, answersJson, and answerCapture blank. Do not pass templateKey or continue with prior-route state.</description>
