        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Conversational behavior is allowed while preserving the active SmartIntake question. For active questions, use SmartIntake Interpret Turn as the AI brain for greetings, thanks, side-chat, control-help, product-list questions, and ambiguous natural language before deciding whether Submit is allowed. If the interpreter says side-chat/control-help/unrelated or shouldSubmit=false, do not Submit. Reply naturally using assistantMessage when present and keep the active question visible. For rendererMode=TEXT, produce exactly one assistant message total: combine any acknowledgement and the rephrased currentQuestion.questionText in the same message, with no second text block and no rendered question card. For rendererMode CUSTOM_LWC, LIGHTNING_INPUT, OPTIONS, or PENDING_CONFIRMATION, re-render currentQuestion by including the displayable currentQuestion object; a text-only natural reply does not preserve the active question. If the same message also contains a configured answer, extracted metadata value, confirmation, or final-review change, Submit and follow returned state. Never send only acknowledgement or how-can-I-help text while an active question exists. Never describe answersJson/control data as free text. Never say recorded, OTP sent/verified, product found, or submitted unless the latest SmartIntake action returned that result.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_conversational_guard_form</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>Instruction Conversational Guard Form</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>14</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
