        <scope>Use this topic for routed SmartIntake CustomerWebClient and Messaging turns when Current_Page is populated and same-route currentQuestion, pendingConfirmation, or runtime state exists. Handle answers, confirmations, final-review changes, replacements, greetings, small talk, meta questions, hesitation, and unrelated requests while keeping the active metadata question in focus. Interpret each latest user message before choosing an action. At final review, change/edit/revise/correct intents must call Submit before repeating the review. If the user names the answer to change, use AI reasoning over final-review metadata to pick one exact questionKey and pass changeQuestionKey. Always follow recommendedNextStep. Non-answer side messages must not restart, save, or invoke Submit; answer naturally and keep same currentQuestion in focus. If no active same-route state, call Get Next Guard first. Use only SmartIntake actions. Do not hardcode template behavior or invent saved-answer errors.</scope>
